{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And I will take you.</b> When you accept the Torah at Mount Sinai." "And the meaning of \"who brings you out\": for it was in the array of the great combination, for the supernal servants, that they would yet remain in exile. And this will become clear to you in the pericope of Ki Tissa."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:03.735462606Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}